# Benchmark corpora and native evidence are deliberately visible to Git. They
# are immutable research records built from fictional subjects and may support
# later evaluation, preference data, or carefully reviewed training datasets.
# The default .prometheist artifact journal is also deliberately visible in
# this development repository. Checked-in journals must contain test/synthetic
# evidence only; real deployments should configure an external artifact root.
